/uploads/origins/8264927c-0c7e-4f44-8657-851adbfcf80c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b4e464398d49eac5b77a08579e509bb4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/956fcae4/uploads/origins/8264927c-0c7e-4f44-8657-851adbfcf80c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df600c796b3c9c2b810985ea15c5f253 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I absolutely love your art and would love to support one of my favorite artists!\n\nI wanted to request if you could draw Dorothy from Va-11 Hall-A! I don't really have a reference for you to work off of, instead I'd like for you to create an original composition. Make it cutesy just like her!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/12", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ec16643e/uploads/origins/63572010-7dbf-4f3c-8d4c-fd265a25e005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5480da9c4b6e4d0627a558f2e1d4933b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ec16643e/uploads/origins/63572010-7dbf-4f3c-8d4c-fd265a25e005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5480da9c4b6e4d0627a558f2e1d4933b, https://si.imgix.net/ec16643e/uploads/origins/63572010-7dbf-4f3c-8d4c-fd265a25e005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9757cef6895c3208af356bdb7744f968 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ec16643e/uploads/origins/63572010-7dbf-4f3c-8d4c-fd265a25e005?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=579561ea769fbd064c90789053b6031e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "OCのリミナリティのイラストが欲しいです。表情は「どうなんだろう...」という感じで、首をかしげたような感じがいいと思います。光輪や翼は入れないでください。普段着ている白いトップスの代わりに、好きな黄色の晴れ着を着て描いてもいいと思います。ありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/s/ok1hyn9i6zt0wk2/Liminality%20ref%20sheet%20jp.png?dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6c713f2d/uploads/origins/a1a6864b-632f-41a6-983d-8d2df5594565?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52be902fc20f8876d545c5cbf8ea6eac", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6c713f2d/uploads/origins/a1a6864b-632f-41a6-983d-8d2df5594565?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52be902fc20f8876d545c5cbf8ea6eac, https://si.imgix.net/6c713f2d/uploads/origins/a1a6864b-632f-41a6-983d-8d2df5594565?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b450510b35511e92459a9f79c11922f0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6c713f2d/uploads/origins/a1a6864b-632f-41a6-983d-8d2df5594565?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b52b8213a08a8354cdc833b7a0cbf219 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "以前からTwitterを拝見しており、過去にVA-11 HALL-Aのジルのイラストを描かれたことがあり、とても気に入っています。同じようなイラストを、VA-11 HALL-Aのベアトリス・アルバートで描いていただけないかと思ったのですが、いかがでしょうか？\n\n参考URLにイラストをリンクしておきました。\nアリガトウ！（笑\n\nhttps://fxtwitter.com/asakirikoko/status/1314192639906906113", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2385b898/uploads/origins/6b0d4a5c-cf8b-4856-a288-f9f1aff8d283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d54a52e9f1f44deffd859db275bdc1ca", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2385b898/uploads/origins/6b0d4a5c-cf8b-4856-a288-f9f1aff8d283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d54a52e9f1f44deffd859db275bdc1ca, https://si.imgix.net/2385b898/uploads/origins/6b0d4a5c-cf8b-4856-a288-f9f1aff8d283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a9775ddb6b7c1236d6480ac3492ff4a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2385b898/uploads/origins/6b0d4a5c-cf8b-4856-a288-f9f1aff8d283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=113037b0eff043367ae5d9879ae103a4 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! \n\nI'd love to request on original character design for a kuudere swamp witch. It'd be nice if she had a few monstrous limbs or features, like her body has started to mutate into sharing features with swamp wildlife (gators, leeches, etc) due to intense experimentation.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/805d23cc/uploads/origins/f2bf8f8b-b164-4d11-96dd-c3a817d7f42f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44b103809f9cbdb9fdc58256bc8db7ed", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/805d23cc/uploads/origins/f2bf8f8b-b164-4d11-96dd-c3a817d7f42f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=44b103809f9cbdb9fdc58256bc8db7ed, https://si.imgix.net/805d23cc/uploads/origins/f2bf8f8b-b164-4d11-96dd-c3a817d7f42f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b39ce87e0d8bedb102e0ccf1f0ae5f67 2x, https://si.imgix.net/805d23cc/uploads/origins/f2bf8f8b-b164-4d11-96dd-c3a817d7f42f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8882529f35097f7942808e40518ddf3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "VRchatというゲームで使っているアバターのラッシュラップを描いてください。\n資料をURLに添付します。\n\n訓練中に本気になってしまって、倒した相手に冷たい表情を向けている場面を相手視点でお願いします。\nふとした時に普段とは違う兵士らしい冷血な一面を隠し持っていることに気づいて、背筋が寒くなるようなキャラが好きです。\n\nhttp://nand74132.sblo.jp/article/189021515.html", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@asakirikoko/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/65203bd7/uploads/origins/07a35eeb-7176-466e-a9c9-4961de8ec59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=096dd050b273479ab23da7ca76309827", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/65203bd7/uploads/origins/07a35eeb-7176-466e-a9c9-4961de8ec59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=096dd050b273479ab23da7ca76309827, https://si.imgix.net/65203bd7/uploads/origins/07a35eeb-7176-466e-a9c9-4961de8ec59c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr